SUMMARY:In The Other Room: Gus Horn
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 3070 Windward Plaza\, Alpharetta
DESCRIPTION:Gus Horn is a Brazilian American comedian that has performed in
  25 countries across 3 continents. A now retired nuclear engineer\, Gus lik
 es to joke that he managed nuclear waste for a living and tells dirty jokes
  to live. Gus was chosen as the opener for the legendary comedian Russell P
 eters during his "Act Your Age" European tour\, and also provided tour supp
 ort for Dave Attell\, Nikki Glaser\, TJ Miller and Rafi Bastos. Gus has per
 formed in some of the top comedy clubs in the USA\, Brazil and Europe\, and
  he was featured on the 2023 Panč Festival in Slovenia. In 2025\, Gus made
  his television debut on “The Noite”\, Brazil’s most watched talk sho
 w hosted by Danilo Gentili\, as well as an appearance on episode 708 of “
 Kill Tony”\, the most popular comedy podcast in the world."\n\nThere is a
  two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with 
 any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks purc
 hased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\nM
 anagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facilit
 y who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https
 ://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/in-the-other-room-gus-horn/
